---
import BaseLayout from '../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Chronicles of DeathEmpire';
const description = 'Notes from the development of DeathEmpire: the archive, the foundations and the old Empire.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="en" enPath="/DeathEmpire/chronicles/" esPath="/DeathEmpire/es/chronicles/">
  <article>
    <header>
      <p class="section-eyebrow">CHRONICLES</p>
      <h1>Chronicles of the Empire</h1>
      <p>Notes from the development of DeathEmpire.</p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Latest</h2>
      <div class="grid" style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">02 OCT 2026 · DEVELOPMENT</p>
            <h3>The Archive takes its next form</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p>A new editorial direction for lore, worldbuilding and discovery: the site now speaks to visitors first, and to builders second.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">28 SEP 2026 · PROJECT STATUS</p>
            <h3>Foundations for protected development</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p>The project advances with a stronger review and delivery process, keeping the canon in Git and the living parts ready for their time.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">20 SEP 2026 · WORLD</p>
            <h3>A first look at the remnants of the old Empire</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p>Ruins, frontiers and the stains of Wild Mana: the world that remains, waiting to be explored.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="note" style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">Chronicles begin as static notes. Dynamic announcements will arrive later without rebuilding the site.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <p><a href="/DeathEmpire/">Back to home</a> · <a href="/DeathEmpire/project/">Discover the project</a></p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
